  "rationale": "10 units of Rusk 200G at Outlet 04 (South Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the expiry deadline on 2026-09-21; doing nothing writes off ₹666 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹796. This play uses a bundle with SKU-BUTTER-500ML at ₹149 for 335 consented customers (Tea connoisseurs, Dairy occasionals, Sweets occasionals, Everyday staples shoppers, Personal care regulars, Festival sweets loyalists): expected 23 units, margin ₹289, discount cost ₹487, waste avoided ₹666 (CI 1 to 68 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" This bundle play pairs Rusk 200G with Butter 500ML at a bundle price of 149 INR, which satisfies the 8% bakery margin floor and is preferred over markdowns by the policy. It targets all high-affinity customer segments to clear the 10 units at risk before the expiry deadline.",
